WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:05.903
Roxy gasped. "Dr. Chen could be Brain Invader!"

2
00:00:05.904 --> 00:00:09.789
General Waltz nodded. "I think she is."

3
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.123
"Don't worry, General," Roxy said.

4
00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:16.896
"I'll stop her. First I have to catch Private Benson and Mighty Man.

5
00:00:16.897 --> 00:00:20.381
They stole a lot of . . . General Waltz?"

6
00:00:20.382 --> 00:00:23.064
The general was gone.

7
00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:26.165
Roxy scratched her head. Then she groaned.

8
00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:31.322
"Ugh! He tricked me! Maybe he's Brain Invader.

9
00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:33.953
I hope Dr. Chen's okay."

10
00:00:33.954 --> 00:00:39.957
She opened her watch and called Dr. Chen.

11
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:44.531
The scientist didn't answer.

12
00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:49.476
Roxy flew to the lab.

13
00:00:49.477 --> 00:00:53.247
She went inside and looked around.

14
00:00:53.248 --> 00:00:57.589
"Rocket Girl!" Dr. Chen was locked in a cell.

15
00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:02.113
"I'm glad you're here! General Waltz is Brain Invader!

16
00:01:02.114 --> 00:01:04.757
He locked me in here!"

17
00:01:04.758 --> 00:01:08.089
Roxy opened the cell door and bit her lip.

18
00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:10.805
What if General Waltz was telling the truth?

19
00:01:10.806 --> 00:01:13.586
What if Dr. Chen was lying?

20
00:01:13.587 --> 00:01:19.865
"Ugh," Roxy thought. She didn't know who was telling the truth!

21
00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:23.940
"General Waltz said that you're Brain Invader," Roxy said.

22
00:01:23.941 --> 00:01:27.193
"He said you refused to use the cure."

23
00:01:27.194 --> 00:01:31.810
Dr. Chen sighed. "I was going to use the cure.

24
00:01:31.811 --> 00:01:37.979
But he controlled my mind and made me stop.

25
00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:43.873
I had several doses of the cure on my workbench. He stole them."

26
00:01:43.874 --> 00:01:46.392
Roxy took a deep breath.

27
00:01:46.393 --> 00:01:50.896
"I believe you. But how will we stop General Waltz?"

28
00:01:50.897 --> 00:01:54.703
Dr. Chen smiled. "I have one dose left.

29
00:01:54.704 --> 00:01:57.074
I hid it in my pocket."

30
00:01:57.075 --> 00:02:00.165
"You're a genius!" Roxy said.

31
00:02:00.166 --> 00:02:06.191
Dr. Chen chuckled. "Well, I am a scientist."

32
00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:09.412
"I'll cure General Waltz," Roxy said.

33
00:02:09.413 --> 00:02:12.834
"Then he won't be able to control anyone."

34
00:02:12.835 --> 00:02:16.686
"He's probably at Army Headquarters," Dr. Chen said.

35
00:02:16.687 --> 00:02:20.391
"But if you go there, he'll control you."

36
00:02:20.392 --> 00:02:25.135
"Nope!" Roxy said. "Steel blocks his power.

37
00:02:25.136 --> 00:02:29.341
I hope you don't mind. But I need the steel from this cell."

38
00:02:29.342 --> 00:02:32.278
"Go ahead," Dr. Chen said.

39
00:02:32.279 --> 00:02:43.476
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams cut a piece from the wall.

40
00:02:43.477 --> 00:02:48.954
Using her heat vision, she heated it up.

41
00:02:48.955 --> 00:02:54.852
It grew soft. She bent and twisted the steel.

42
00:02:54.853 --> 00:02:57.733
Soon she had a helmet.

43
00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:02.073
Roxy kept working.

44
00:03:02.074 --> 00:03:05.701
A few minutes later, she wore a shiny steel suit.

45
00:03:05.702 --> 00:03:08.979
"Now the general can't control me."

46
00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:12.775
"Perfect!" Dr. Chen gave Roxy the device.

47
00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:18.219
"I'll make more doses for Private Benson and Mighty Man. Oh, and the skunk."

48
00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:21.304
Zoom! Roxy shot out of the lab.

49
00:03:21.305 --> 00:03:24.217
She flew toward Army Headquarters.

50
00:03:24.218 --> 00:03:27.462
"Stop right there!" a voice shouted.

51
00:03:27.463 --> 00:03:39.770
Roxy gulped. Dozens of soldiers blocked the entrance!

